Z||000006||fierogtracer||09-24-2001||11:15 PM||||Visceral:<BR>Where they are at is not useless. I have cut the tirewell and added a "Half Duct" to the area, and reinforced the cut area with a support brace. So now the air follows a more natural flow. When you put them between the headlights the air hits the tirewell causing drag and is forced up out of the vents. Probably not very measurable but still drag.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature_11.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by fierogtracer (edited 09-24-2001).]||||reg||1
